OL,3,GNEWSARed Arrows cancel Guernsey show,
OL,4,Abut not Jersey's
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Red Arrows have cancelled their
OL,7,Fappearance at the Guernsey Air Show -
OL,8,Fwhile organisers of the Jersey
OL,9,FInternational Air Display say they are
OL,10,Fstill expecting the team to attend.
OL,12,FThe Royal Air Force's aeronautic
OL,13,Fdisplay team was set to open the 2026
OL,14,FGuernsey Battle of Britain Air Display
OL,15,Fin St Peter Port on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
