OL,3,GNEWSARed Arrows cancel Guernsey show,
OL,4,Abut not Jersey's
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Red Arrows said they were facing
OL,7,F"issues with aircraft and engineering
OL,8,Fresource", which meant they could not
OL,9,Fdeploy seven jets as planned for the
OL,10,Fevent on Wednesday. They acknowledged
OL,11,Fthe "disappointment" this would cause
OL,12,Fto the "people of Guernsey", especially
OL,13,Fgiven the "late notice".
OL,15,FJersey display organisers said on
OL,16,Fsocial media they had not been advised
OL,17,Fof issues.
